        <page pageNum="1">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="1" who="Yoo Jin-Ho">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="1"/> T... THE ENTRANCE!! 
            </bubble>
            <caption type="thought" who="Sung Jin-Woo" thtNum="1"> THOSE BASTARDS </caption>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="2" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="2"/> ARE THE &lt;LIZARDS&gt;! 
            </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="2">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="2" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> LIZARDS? 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="3" who="Old Man">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="3"/> SOMETIMES, THERE ARE LIZARD-LIKE BASTARDS. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="4" who="Old Man">
                <unique ans="n"/> AS IT'S A PRETTY DANGEROUS JOB, ACCIDENTS INSIDE THE DUNGEON ARE
                COMMON. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="5" who="Old Man">
                <unique ans="n"/> AND EVEN IF A CRIME OCCURED, IT'S HARD TO PROVE, SO THEY ARE
                COMMON PLACE AS WELL 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="6" who="Old Man">
                <unique ans="n"/> THERE IS NO SUCH THING AS A CCTV THAT CAN BE VIEWED FROM OUTSIDE,
                SO WHO WOULD STOP THE HUNTERS? NOBODY CAN STOP THEM 
            </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="3">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="7" who="Old Man">
                <unique ans="n"/> THE WEAKER YOU ARE, THE FASTER YOU GET THROWN AWAY, BUT IF
                    YOU"RE STRONG, PEOPLE WILL SEEK THAT STRENGTH. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="8" who="Old Man">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF THEY SAY YOU'RE USELESS OR YOU GET IN THE WAY ... 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="9" who="Old Man">
                <unique ans="n"/> LIKE A LIZARD LEAVING ITS TAIL, YOU GET CUT AWAY. 
            </bubble>
            <caption type="narration" who="Old Man" > THAT'S WHY I'M TELLING YOU
                TO BE CAREFUL. </caption>
            <caption type="narration" spNum="10" who="Old Man"> &quot;WORLD'S WEAKEST HUNTER&quot;</caption>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="4">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="11" who="Yoo Jin-Ho" >
                <unique ans="n"/> WHAT DO WE DO?! 
