            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="17" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> BUT IT WOULD BE GOOD IF YOU DIDN'T PAY ATTENTION TO SMALL THINGS THAT MUCH. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="18" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> HUH? 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="5" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> SO THAT'S WHAT HE MEANT. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="6" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> DID HE SAY HE WAS JO GYU-HWAN? 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="7" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THE C-RANK MAGICIAN WITH THE LIGHT. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="8" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> HE BLOCKED IT OFF PRETTY WELL. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="9" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> GETTING OUT ISN'T THAT BIG OF A PROBLEM, BUT... 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="10" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THAT THING WOKE DUE TO THE BLAST... 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="11" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THAT'S A PROBLEM. 
            </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="5">
            <caption type="thought" thtNum="12" who="Sung Jin-WOO">A C-RANK DUNGEON BOSS!</caption>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="19" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> SINCE WE MEMORISED THE WAY, GETTING OUT IS A PIECE OF CAKE. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="20" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> LET'S GO BACK AFTER A REST. 
            </bubble>
