                    KILLED THEM BACK THERE... 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="23" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> IDIOT, IF WE FOUGHT THERE AND THE SPIDER
                    WOKE UP, HOW WOULD WE MINE AND MOVE THE MANA CRYSTALS? 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="24" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> WITH THE WORLD'S WEAKEST E-RANK HUNTER, AND A D-RANK
                    HUNTER WITH ABSOLUTELY NO RAID EXPERIENCE IT'S IMPOSSIBLE FOR THEM TO BEAT THE
                    DUNGEON BOSS, NO MATTER HOW HARD THEY TRY. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="25" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> AFTER THE SPIDER BOSS EATS THEM AND GOES BACK TO SLEEP,
                    WE CAN TAKE ADVANTAGE OF THAT AND MINE THE MANA CRYSTALS. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="26" who="others">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF THAT DOESN'T WORK, WE'LL HAVE TO KILL THE BOSS... 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="27" who="others">
                <unique ans="n"/> BUT DID YOU SEE YOO JIN-HO'S EQUIPMENT? 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="28" who="others">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT LOOKED LIKE THE SWORD AND SHIELD ALONE WOULD GO FOR
                    MILLIONS OF WON. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="29" who="others">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF WE CAN'T BRING ALL THE MANA CRYSTALS BACK, WE CAN AT LEAST
                    TAKE HIS STUFF. 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="30" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> LET'S FIND OUT WHICH RICH HOUSEHOLD HE'S FROM 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="31" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> WE SHOULD AT LEAST TAKE CARE OF HIS FUNERAL 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="32" who="Jo Gyu-Hwan">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="6"/> SINCE THE WALL CAUSED QUITE A STIR, 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="33" who="Jo Gyu-Hwan">
                <unique ans="n"/> SHOULDN'T THE BOSS BE QUITE ANGRY RIGHT NOW? 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="34" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> GYU-HWAN, 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="35" who="Hwang Dong-Suk">
                <unique ans="n"/> DO YOU HAVE THE CONFIDENCE TO BEAT THAT MONSTER ON YOUR OWN? 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="36" who="Jo Gyu-Hwan">
